>  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dist[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ans </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ans, dist[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ans;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>简单版本</th>\n<th>优化版本（最小堆）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(V × E)（数组排序瓶颈）</td>\n<td>O((V + E) log V)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(V + E)</td>\n<td>O(V + E)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 优化版本中，每个节点最多入堆一次，每次堆操作 O(log V)，对每条边最多松弛一次。因此总时间为 O((V + E) log V)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 邻接表存储图需要 O(V + E)，距离数组和堆各需 O(V)，总空间 O(V + E)。</p>\n<p><strong>实际表现：</strong> 在 n ≤ 100、E ≤ 6000 的约束下，两种实现都能高效通过。但在更大规模的图中，最小堆版本的优势会更加明显。Dijkstra 算法是面试中<strong>出现频率最高</strong>的图算法之一，建议熟练掌握模板。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 743 网络延迟时间","id":"leetcode-743-网络延迟时间"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 315 计算右侧小于当前元素的个数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-advanced-ds/lc0315-count-of-smaller-numbers"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 787 K 站中转内最便宜的航班","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-graph-advanced/lc0787-cheapest-flights-k-stops"}}